  "details": "1. I Opened VRChat across PC and Standalone \n\n2. Loaded into my home world \n\n3. I Loaded in as an error bot instead of the model I uploaded or saved \n\n4. I occasionally load in after signing in to the basic home world instead of the one I saved. \n\n5. When I drop a portal sometimes it will not appear to me but it will appear to others \n\n6. I occasionally can not see avatars in the previews in my saved folders or in avatar worlds. \n\n7. Some users I have never met before do not appear to me at all and are invisible but I can hear their voices in the location of their hit box. \n\n8. I occasionally see my friends as Error robots and force turning them on does not work. \n\n9. When I enter a portal dropped by friends ( and it doesn’t matter which world we are going to) it will boot me back to my homeworld and keep me locked in until I try 10 or more times to leave.\n\nThis has been happening for about 2 days since I got a disconnect error and tried to sign back in. And it seems to be an issue with my account in general.",
